msgctxt "160"
msgid "What do you want to be when you grow up, Eri-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Hmmmm, maybe a flight attendant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yeah, 'cause you're such an airhead, heehee!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Is Shiro gonna be okay, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "He'll be just fine, I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Wow, really?"
msgstr "Wow, davvero?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Yup. I'm gonna make sure of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "Va bene!"

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Did Shiro tell you anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Not really, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Oh. Sorry I can't be more help, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "It's all right, Ayako. I appreciate the effort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "What's up, Uncle Kaz? Is this about Shiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Yeah, something's definitely up. Do you know if he's having\r\n"
"trouble at school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "I'm not sure. We're not in the same grade..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Have you heard anything, Izumi-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Ummm, nope. We're in different classes, so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Giusto..."

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Want me to try asking him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Nah, it's okay. If he's gonna open up to anyone, it'd\r\n"
"probably be another guy. I'll give it another shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Did you find Shiro, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Not yet, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Oh... Want us to help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "It's okay. Probably best that I do it alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "You girls have any idea where Shiro is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I don't. Eri-chan? Izumi-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr "No."

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Nuh-uh."
msgstr "Macché."

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"I saw Taichi and Mitsuo playing on the beach. Maybe he's\r\n"
"with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "I'll go take a look. Thanks, Ayako."
msgstr ""

